2026-09-14T12:21:15.5114307Z         for change in ({"max_package_files": 2}, {"max_package_bytes": 100}, {"max_compression_ratio": 1}):
2026-09-14T12:21:15.5114911Z             with pytest.raises(ImportParsingError) as error:
